{"2093780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Patrol", "steam_appid": 2093780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/5671f72426c1ab587091069562157bee.poster.avif?t=1773457420\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/5671f72426c1ab587091069562157bee.webm?t=1773457420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/5671f72426c1ab587091069562157bee.mp4?t=1773457420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the post-human wastes of the distant future, you are dispatched to stop the <i>Finis Omnia</i>, a cult hellbent on tearing open reality to unleash an eldritch horror. Armed with mutative upgrades, you’ll blast, interrogate, and investigate your way through a surreal, intergalactic nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a half-organic, half-synthetic law enforcer, mutating to achieve order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <i>Afterflesh </i>— an intergalactic nightmare of space stations, alien planets, and pocket dimensions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in frenetic top-down combat against cultists, mutants, and otherworldly abominations, using an arsenal of bio-engineered weaponry.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate a cast of bizarre NPCs to unravel the cult’s conspiracy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/00b28ed65b21e8f104fdf9405bb4becf.avif?t=1773457420\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/5671f72426c1ab587091069562157bee.poster.avif?t=1773457420\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/5671f72426c1ab587091069562157bee.webm?t=1773457420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/5671f72426c1ab587091069562157bee.mp4?t=1773457420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the post-human wastes of the distant future, you are dispatched to stop the <i>Finis Omnia</i>, a cult hellbent on tearing open reality to unleash an eldritch horror. Armed with mutative upgrades, you’ll blast, interrogate, and investigate your way through a surreal, intergalactic nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a half-organic, half-synthetic law enforcer, mutating to achieve order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <i>Afterflesh </i>— an intergalactic nightmare of space stations, alien planets, and pocket dimensions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in frenetic top-down combat against cultists, mutants, and otherworldly abominations, using an arsenal of bio-engineered weaponry.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate a cast of bizarre NPCs to unravel the cult’s conspiracy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/00b28ed65b21e8f104fdf9405bb4becf.avif?t=1773457420\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are an Orderlord — a mutating meatball cop battling cultists in a surreal post-human dystopia. Evolve your form, investigate an intergalactic conspiracy, and prevent cosmic annihilation in this top-down horror shooter.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/3ac2ef10b216a529c2276e4a38c75b40cbf95abe/header.jpg?t=1773457420", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/e31ce62639406cb943fb5c9fbe9b2cd6014a32c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773457420", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/e31ce62639406cb943fb5c9fbe9b2cd6014a32c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773457420", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Buzzsaw Dreams"], "publishers": ["Buzzsaw Dreams"], "demos": [{"appid": 4014660, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/ab5b9e23d04bad4c9228f8decbb1003117a284b0/ss_ab5b9e23d04bad4c9228f8decbb1003117a284b